  - id: 3
    name: main_03_pendant
    title: "N\u1EEDa m\u1EA3nh ng\u1ECDc b\u1ED9i"
    category: 0
    chapter: 1
    giver: healer
    turnIn: scholar
    minTier: 0
    requires: main_02_slime_plague
    repeatable: 0
    condition:
      requiresFlag: 
      forbidsFlag: 
      tierNpc: 
      minTier: 0
      minAllies: 0
      allyTier: 3
      item: 
      itemCount: 1
    offer:
    - "Ng\u1ECDc n\xE0y c\xF3 v\xE2n nh\u01B0 m\xE2y cu\u1ED9n... b\xE0 t\u1EEBng
      th\u1EA5y h\xECnh n\xE0y trong s\xE1ch c\u1ED5."
    - "C\xF4 Ng\xE2n xem qu\u1EBB gi\u1ECFi, c\xF3 khi c\xF4 \u1EA5y bi\u1EBFt \u0111i\u1EC1u
      g\xEC. Con qua h\u1ECFi c\xF4 \u1EA5y, r\u1ED3i mang chuy\u1EC7n t\u1EDBi Th\u1EA7y
      Uy\xEAn. Th\u1EA7y \u0111\u1ECDc nhi\u1EC1u s\xE1ch nh\u1EA5t l\xE0ng."
    inProgress: "G\u1EB7p C\xF4 Ng\xE2n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, r\u1ED3i t\u1EDBi ch\u1ED7
      Th\u1EA7y Uy\xEAn."
    complete:
    - "\u0110\u01B0a ta xem... V\xE2n m\xE2y cu\u1ED9n, kh\u1EAFc ch\u1EEF \"Huy\u1EC1n\".
      \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 ng\u1ECDc b\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a Huy\u1EC1n \u1EA8n!"
    - "Ba tr\u0103m n\u0103m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, Huy\u1EC1n \u1EA8n l\u1EADp \u1EA4n
      Ng\u0169 H\xE0nh \u0111\u1EC3 giam m\u1ED9t th\u1EE9 d\u01B0\u1EDBi n\xFAi
      Linh S\u01A1n. Ch\xECa c\u1EE7a \u1EA5n ch\xEDnh l\xE0 mi\u1EBFng ng\u1ECDc
      n\xE0y, chia l\xE0m \u0111\xF4i."
    offerChoices: []
    turnInPrompt: 
    outcomes: []
    objectives:
    - kind: 3
      target: fortune
      count: 1
      label: 
      where:
        mapId: -1
        point: {x: 0, y: 0}
        radius: 5
      lines:
      - "...Ba \u0111\u1ED3ng xu c\xF9ng \u0111\u1EE9ng. Ta ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng th\u1EA5y
        qu\u1EBB n\xE0y."
      - "M\u1EA3nh ng\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t n\u1EEDa.
        N\u1EEDa kia \u0111ang n\u1EB1m d\u01B0\u1EDBi l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5t, trong
        tay th\u1EE9 \u0111ang h\xFAt linh kh\xED c\u1EE7a v\xF9ng n\xE0y."
      - "\u0110i g\u1EB7p Th\u1EA7y Uy\xEAn \u0111i. Qu\u1EBB n\xF3i th\u1EA7y \u1EA5y
        gi\u1EEF ch\xECa kh\xF3a c\u1EE7a c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n."
    gold: 200
    exp: 800
