    - "\u0110\xEAm qua l\u0169 R\xF9a mai b\xF2 t\u1EDBi t\u1EADn ch\xE2n t\u01B0\u1EDDng
      ph\xEDa \u0111\xF4ng. D\u1EB9p ch\xFAng \u0111i, r\u1ED3i ta s\u1EBD tin ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a Huy\u1EC1n \u1EA8n."
    inProgress: "B\xE3i R\xF9a mai \u1EDF ph\xEDa \u0111\xF4ng l\xE0ng. Mai ch\xFAng
